  description: "User-approved vocal-echo entrance: start at outgoing canonical beat 110, four beats before the chosen nor slice. Fade melody/bass/drums out over the first beat, then apply a half-beat echo to vocals only. Let the real nor flow into the sustained vowel; remove the full-mix opening sampler retrigger. Stop the dry vocal after the syllable and retain its echo tail, fading the deck out before rapid tone play. Four-beat hold before rapid passes at 8 and 24. Original rapid-note slice 114–114.5, C/C-sharp pitches, short gates, velocities and Gasolina attack alignment remain unchanged. Requires prepared Not Like Us stems. No song grids or permanent cues changed."
